---
import { CONTACT_LINKS } from "../config/site";
import SystemPageLayout from "../layouts/SystemPageLayout.astro";
---

<SystemPageLayout
  title="About"
  moduleCode=""
  active="about"
  description="A little about me and this corner of the internet."
  showDescription={false}
>
  <div class="about-copy">
    <p class="about-intro">I'm Tien, from Vietnam.</p>

    <p>
      I studied biotechnology, wandered into bioinformatics, and somehow ended
      up working with computers. I still find it amusing how life takes us to
      places we never planned to go.
    </p>

    <p>
      I like coffee, photography, old cars, mechanical watches, and quiet roads
      at night. I enjoy reading memoirs and autobiographies. There is something
      fascinating about seeing the world through someone else's lifetime.
    </p>

    <p>
      I love the sea and jellyfish. I also particularly love <em>komorebi</em> (<span lang="ja">木漏れ日
</span>) — sunlight filtering
      through the leaves of trees. Some things are beautiful without needing
      much explanation.
    </p>

    <p>
      I enjoy building things, taking them apart, and figuring out how they
      work. Not everything needs to be useful. Sometimes curiosity is reason
      enough.
    </p>

    <p>
      This website is a little corner of the internet I keep for myself. A
      collection of technical notes, experiments, small games, wandering
      thoughts, and whatever else interests me along the way.
    </p>

    <p>
      I may forget things. I may relearn them. I may change my mind about
      something I once believed. I think that's a perfectly fine way to go
      through life.
    </p>

    <p>Like a jellyfish drifting with the current, I don't always know where I'm going.</p>

    <p>And that's fine, too.</p>

    <p>Thanks for stopping by.</p>

    <nav class="about-links" aria-label="Contact links">
      {
        CONTACT_LINKS.map(({ href, label, external }) => (
          <a
            href={href}
            target={external ? "_blank" : undefined}
            rel={external ? "noopener noreferrer" : undefined}
          >
            {label}
            {external && <span aria-hidden="true">&#x2197;&#xFE0E;</span>}
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </nav>
  </div>
</SystemPageLayout>
